 "html": "<section style=\"max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding-left:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-right:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-top:clamp(48px,7vw,96px);padding-bottom:clamp(48px,6vw,80px)\"><nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:13px;color:#6E6C8A\"><a href=\"/\" style=\"color:#6E6C8A\">Home</a><span>/</span><a href=\"/stablecoins\" style=\"color:#6E6C8A\">Stablecoins</a><span>/</span><span style=\"color:#3B2ED3\">Stablecoin payments in Nigeria</span></nav><h1 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(34px, 2.2vw + 26px, 58px);line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-0.045em;font-weight:700;margin:28px 0 0;max-width:16ch\">Stablecoin payments in Nigeria, through one API<span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:inline-block;width:.2em;height:.2em;margin-left:.06em;background:#FFB224\"></span></h1><p style=\"font-size:clamp(17px,1.4vw,19px);line-height:1.55;color:#4C4A66;margin:24px 0 0;max-width:56ch\">Pay Nigerian suppliers, staff and partners in naira from a USDC or USDT balance, or collect naira from customers and settle in stablecoins. Payouts go to any Nigerian bank account.</p><div style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:32px\"><a href=\"/contact\" style=\"padding:16px 26px;border-radius:999px;font-size:16px;font-weight:500;background:#3B2ED3;color:#fff\" class=\"dp-1uxoczp\">Talk to sales</a><a href=\"/#platform\" style=\"padding:16px 26px;border-radius:999px;font-size:16px;font-weight:500;background:#F6F4EF;color:#131126\" class=\"dp-1u9awz2\">See the platform →</a></div></section>\n<div style=\"background:#F6F4EF\">\n<section style=\"max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding-left:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-right:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-top:clamp(64px,8vw,112px)\"><h2 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(30px, 1.9vw + 23px, 52px);line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-0.04em;font-weight:700;margin:0\">What you can do in Nigeria.</h2><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,260px),1fr));gap:12px;margin-top:32px\"><div style=\"padding:28px;border-radius:24px;background:#fff\"><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(19px, 0.45vw + 17px, 24px);line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-0.02em;font-weight:700;margin:0\">Pay suppliers with stablecoins</h3><p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#4C4A66;margin:10px 0 0\">Fund in USDC or USDT and pay invoices in NGN to the supplier’s bank account, with the rate fixed before you confirm.</p></div><div style=\"padding:28px;border-radius:24px;background:#fff\"><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(19px, 0.45vw + 17px, 24px);line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-0.02em;font-weight:700;margin:0\">Collect naira, settle in USDC</h3><p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#4C4A66;margin:10px 0 0\">Accept bank transfers in NGN from customers and settle into USDC or USDT to protect value.</p></div><div style=\"padding:28px;border-radius:24px;background:#fff\"><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(19px, 0.45vw + 17px, 24px);line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-0.02em;font-weight:700;margin:0\">Payroll in Nigeria</h3><p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#4C4A66;margin:10px 0 0\">Pay staff and contractors in NGN on the same day each month, from one stablecoin balance.</p></div><div style=\"padding:28px;border-radius:24px;background:#fff\"><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(19px, 0.45vw + 17px, 24px);line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-0.02em;font-weight:700;margin:0\">Embed it in your product</h3><p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#4C4A66;margin:10px 0 0\">Fintechs and platforms offer NGN on- and off-ramps to their own users through our API.</p></div></div></section>\n<section style=\"max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding-left:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-right:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-top:clamp(64px,8vw,112px)\"><h2 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(30px, 1.9vw + 23px, 52px);line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-0.04em;font-weight:700;margin:0\">How it works.</h2><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,240px),1fr));gap:12px;margin-top:32px\"><div style=\"padding:28px;border-radius:28px;background:#3B2ED3;color:#fff\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:13px;color:inherit;opacity:.75\">01</span><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(19px, 0.45vw + 17px, 24px);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin:12px 0 0\">Verify your business</h3><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:23px;color:inherit;opacity:.85;margin:8px 0 0\">Complete onboarding once. No separate Nigerian entity needed to start paying out.</p></div><div style=\"padding:28px;border-radius:28px;background:#FFB224;color:#131126\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:13px;color:inherit;opacity:.75\">02</span><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(19px, 0.45vw + 17px, 24px);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin:12px 0 0\">Fund in USDC or USDT</h3><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:23px;color:inherit;opacity:.85;margin:8px 0 0\">Send stablecoins to your deposit address or use your existing balance.</p></div><div style=\"padding:28px;border-radius:28px;background:#7C6FFF;color:#131126\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:13px;color:inherit;opacity:.75\">03</span><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(19px, 0.45vw + 17px, 24px);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin:12px 0 0\">Pay out in NGN</h3><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:23px;color:inherit;opacity:.85;margin:8px 0 0\">Send to any Nigerian bank account by API, dashboard or bulk file.</p></div><div style=\"padding:28px;border-radius:28px;background:#5ED6B4;color:#131126\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:13px;color:inherit;opacity:.75\">04</span><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(19px, 0.45vw + 17px, 24px);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin:12px 0 0\">Reconcile</h3><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:23px;color:inherit;opacity:.85;margin:8px 0 0\">Each payout returns a status, a bank reference and your own reference.</p></div></div></section>\n<section style=\"max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding-left:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-right:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-top:clamp(64px,8vw,112px)\"><h2 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(30px, 1.9vw + 23px, 52px);line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-0.04em;font-weight:700;margin:0\">Related routes.</h2><div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:28px\"><a href=\"/usdc-to-nigeria\" style=\"padding:12px 18px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;color:#131126;font-weight:500;font-size:15px\" class=\"dp-1hp7yy2\">USDC to Nigeria</a><a href=\"/usdt-to-nigeria\" style=\"padding:12px 18px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;color:#131126;font-weight:500;font-size:15px\" class=\"dp-1hp7yy2\">USDT to Nigeria</a><a href=\"/send-money-to-nigeria\" style=\"padding:12px 18px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;color:#131126;font-weight:500;font-size:15px\" class=\"dp-1hp7yy2\">Send money to Nigeria</a><a href=\"/send-money-from-uk-to-nigeria\" style=\"padding:12px 18px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;color:#131126;font-weight:500;font-size:15px\" class=\"dp-1hp7yy2\">UK to Nigeria</a><a href=\"/send-money-from-us-to-nigeria\" style=\"padding:12px 18px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;color:#131126;font-weight:500;font-size:15px\" class=\"dp-1hp7yy2\">US to Nigeria</a><a href=\"/send-money-from-china-to-nigeria\" style=\"padding:12px 18px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;color:#131126;font-weight:500;font-size:15px\" class=\"dp-1hp7y